>
  <p>North York is postwar bungalow territory, and much of its concrete is original. Driveways, walkways and front steps poured in the 1950s and 60s have now taken sixty or seventy winters of salt and freeze-thaw, and it shows: heaved joints, scaled surfaces, crumbling nosings. At the same time, the busy infill streets need new flatwork for new builds. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> handles both, and we back each job with a 2-year warranty.</p>

  <p>We also see a lot of North York side yards. On narrow lots the side walkway is the main path to the backyard, and where it is missing or failed, water tracks straight along the foundation. A properly graded side walk is one of the cheapest ways to protect a basement, and we pour them every week.</p>

  <h2>Working with builders and homeowners</h2>
  <p>For infill and renovation projects, we schedule flatwork to fit the build and coordinate with your other trades. For homeowners, it is simpler: one visit to measure, one written quote, one crew that shows up on the day we agreed.</p>

  <h2>What we pour in North York</h2>
  <p>North York calls usually ask for one of these:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-driveways/">Concrete driveways</a>, replacements of original postwar pours</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">Walkways</a>, front and side yard</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-porches/">Porches</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">steps</a>, repaired or rebuilt</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-slabs/">Slabs</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-foundations/">foundation flatwork</a> for infill builds and garages</li>
    <li><a href="/services/parging/">Parging</a>, <a href="/services/concrete-repair/">repair</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-replacement/">replacement</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why North York homeowners keep choosing us</h2>
  <p>Fifteen years of local pours, straight answers about what the job needs, and a written quote with room to think. The schedule we hand you on day one is the one we keep.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty on all our work</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed, every job</li>
    <li>Free quotes, no obligation</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Photos and a short description through the form is all it takes; every project follows our clear <a href="/#process">six-step process</a>. We pour across <a href="/locations/toronto/">Toronto</a> and north into <a href="/locations/vaughan/">Vaughan</a> as well, so one call covers family or rental properties nearby.</p>
